        "created_at": "2021-03-28T06:41:26.005Z",
        "cooked": "<p>super recent episodes of Letters Page state that Pike is becoming a public figure as a philanthropist business leader. He has the same name as the founder but obviously it must be his grandson or something, and the Pike Industries CEO has been an unseen recluse for decades so who can say.<br>\nZhu Long is setting up his new Temple in ©Rook City, the magic rifts might not help him but there is a “magic underground” that he is taking advantage of<br>\nThe Dark Watch heroes have started a larger “city watch” type organization with people training with Mantra and giving information to Ex-Pat for C&amp;C</p>",
